### Play publication — nothing here may ever be committed ###
# Upload keystore. In CI it is rebuilt under $RUNNER_TEMP from ANDROID_KEYSTORE_BASE64 and
# never lands in the working tree; locally it is pointed at by KEYSTORE_FILE in
# local.properties, ideally at a path outside the repository.
*.jks
*.keystore
# Play service-account key, written by the workflow from PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON.
fastlane/play-service-account.json
# Fastlane's own scratch output.
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/README.md
/vendor/bundle
.bundle/
# Android Studio's "Generate Signed Bundle" output. The published bundle comes from CI, and a
# hand-built one at a versionCode CI does not know about is exactly what Play refuses later.
/androidApp/release/
